# Build context for the redaction sidecar (audit 2.0 SEC-31). Without this the
# `COPY app ./app` below shipped app/__pycache__/ — stale bytecode compiled by
# whatever Python the developer happened to run — into the image.
#
# Allowlist, same shape as the repo-root .dockerignore: deny everything, then
# name the few paths the build actually needs.
*
!Dockerfile
!requirements.txt
!requirements.lock
!app

# Belt and braces inside the allowed app/ tree.
app/__pycache__
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
